Package: STBench
Type: Package
Title: Normalisation and Benchmarking for Spatial Transcriptomics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Your",
        family = "Name",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "your@email.com"
    )
Description: Provides a unified framework for applying and benchmarking
    normalisation methods for spatial transcriptomics data. The package
    supports multiple normalisation approaches, spatially variable gene
    analysis, marker gene evaluation, spatial expression visualisation,
    and stable gene-set benchmarking.
